   "sentenceId": 8,
   "he": "מַתְנִי׳ בֵּית שַׁמַּאי אוֹמְרִים: פּוֹטֵר אָדָם אִשְׁתּוֹ בְּגֵט יָשָׁן. וּבֵית הִלֵּל אוֹסְרִין. וְאֵיזֶהוּ גֵּט יָשָׁן – כֹּל שֶׁנִּתְיַיחֵד עִמָּהּ מֵאַחַר שֶׁכְּתָבוֹ לָהּ.",
   "en": "«MISHNA:» «Beit Shammai say: A man may send,» i.e., divorce, «his wife with an outdated bill of divorce, and Beit Hillel prohibit» him from doing so. «And what is an outdated bill of divorce? Any» case «where he was secluded with her after he wrote it for her» and before he gave it to her."
  }
